t claim\n30. should cap total payout per policy at twice the insurance sum -- sword insured (cap 2000 G), first claim 1500 G → second claim max 600 G\n31. should maintain cap exhaustion across claims -- first claim 1400 G, cap remaining 600 G; second claim 600 G, cap remaining 0 G\n32. should base cap on unmodified insurance value -- cursed sword insurance value 1000 G → cap 2000 G\n33. should handle building block of components in insurance sum correctly -- sword and 3 runes → insurance sum 1750 G\n34. should round final premium up in MHPCO's favor -- 197.5 G → 198 G\n35. should round final payout down in MHPCO's favor -- 350.5 G → 350 G\n36. should verify new customer with cursed sword → premium 165 G\n37. should verify long-standing customer's second contract with cursed, highly enchanted sword → premium 160 G\n\nTest"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950717112,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-51131537-88e9-4696-a0bf-4e4f1967ffa2","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
