irst insurance carries 10% surcharge\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply 15% discount on contracts after the first -- second contract → 15% discount on policy base premium\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply both loyalty and follow-up discounts correctly -- 3-year customer, second contract, cursed sword → 160 G premium\");\n  it.todo(\"should add 5 G processing fee to every premium -- empty list → 5 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should calculate premium for empty item list -- 5 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should reject quote with unknown item type and exit with non-zero status -- type: broomstick → error\");\n  it.todo(\"should reject claim with item not part of the policy and exit with non-zero status -- amulet damaged when only sword insured → error\");\n  it.todo(\"should reject claim with unknown item type in damage and exit with non-zero status -- unknown type in damage → error\");\n  it.todo(\"should reject claim with negative damage amount and exit with non-zero status -- amount: -200 → error\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply 100 G deductible per damage event -- sword damage 500 G → payout 400 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply 100 G deductible per damage event for components -- rune damage 200 G → payout 100 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply 50% reimbursement for items with enchantment level ≥ 8 -- dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should fully reimburse dragon-material items -- dragon-material sword, enchantment 5, damage 800 G → payout 700 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should apply both dragon-material and high-enchantment rules with dragon-material winning -- dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should fully reimburse steel sword with enchantment 9? -- steel sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G\");\n  it.todo(\"should verify damage entries match insured items -- two sword damages but only one sword insured → reject claim\");\n  it.todo(\"should cap total payout per policy at twice the insurance su